; A voice is an FM channel's sound. presets/gm holds 128 of them, named after
; the General MIDI instruments: import the set, then name a voice at the start
; of a track.
; Try: give fm1 another voice: gm-vibes, gm-flute, gm-brass …
(import "presets/gm/set.mmlisp")
(fm1 gm-piano c4 e4 g4 e4)
(fm2 gm-bass-finger :oct 2 c2 g2)
